OL,3,ACCTV shows Noah Woods, 3, at playground
OL,4,Abefore he went missing as hundreds join
OL,5,Asearch
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice release CCTV showing Noah Woods,
OL,8,F3, about half an hour before he
OL,9,Fdisappeared from a playground in
OL,10,FSuffolk on Tuesday at about 15:00 BST
OL,12,FThe three-year-old, who is partially
OL,13,Fdeaf and non-verbal, was with a
OL,14,Frelative in Brantham before he went
OL,15,Fmissing, Suffolk Police say. He is
OL,16,Funlikely to respond to his name being
OL,17,Fcalled, police added
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
